{"id": "85969", "name": "גזירה פרמטרית – dy/dx עבור x=sin(at), y=cos(at) (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Find \\(\\frac{dy}{dx}\\) in terms of {{CT:0}} when \\(x\\) and \\(y\\) are related by the following pair of parametric equations:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ x={{CT:1}} \\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ y={{CT:2}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\frac{dy}{dx} = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Differentiate \\(x\\) and \\(y\\) with respect to the parameter and divide the two derivatives.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — The derivative of a parametric curve</b><br><p>If \\(x\\) and \\(y\\) are both functions of a parameter \\(t\\), then</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{dy}{dx} = \\frac{dy}{dt}/\\frac{dx}{dt} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Differentiating</b><br><p>\\(y={{CT:2}}\\) and \\(x={{CT:1}}\\), so</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\begin{array}{rcl}\\displaystyle \\frac{dy}{dx} &\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle \\frac{dy}{d{{CT:3}}}/\\frac{dx}{d{{CT:3}}} \\\\ &\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle \\frac{d}{d{{CT:3}}}[{{CT:2}}]/\\frac{d}{d{{CT:3}}}[{{CT:1}}] \\\\ &\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle \\frac{{CT:4}}{{CT:5}} \\\\ &\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle {{CT:6}} \\end{array} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "Diff", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "factor(diff(y,v)/diff(x,v))", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "-factor(diff(y,v)/diff(x,v))", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Your answer is the negative of what it should be. Have you mislaid a sign?</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "factor(diff(x,v)/diff(y,v))", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">You seem to have found \\(\\frac{dx}{dy}\\).</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "Result-2-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "diff(y,v)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-3-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">You have found \\(\\frac{dy}{d{{CT:3}}}\\) not \\(\\frac{dy}{x}\\).</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "Result-3-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 4, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "diff(x,v)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-4-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">You have found \\(\\frac{dx}{d{{CT:3}}}\\) not \\(\\frac{dy}{x}\\).</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-4-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["rdm1", "v", "x", "y"], "nvariants": 4}